{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29022","headline":"李秀才近自涂口迁居新安适枉缄书见寛悲戚因以此答 · 许浑","name":"李秀才近自涂口迁居新安适枉缄书见寛悲戚因以此答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远书开罢更依依，晨坐高台竟落晖。\n颜巷雪深人已去，庾楼花盛客初归。\n东堂望绝迁莺起，南国哀余候鴈飞。\n今日劳君犹问讯，一官唯长故山薇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}